  {
   "uuid": "e0750711-1aba-4141-8470-090b1dfc4a6e",
   "slug": "v801-11",
   "name": "V801-11",
   "class_name": "RADR_GRNP_S01_V80111",
   "classification": "Ship.Radar.MidRangeRadar",
   "classification_label": "Mid Range Radar",
   "description": {
    "en_EN": "Designed for the battlefield, the V801-11 is a cut above the rest thanks to the rigid, iterative testing, guaranteeing its performance when you need it most.",
    "de_DE": "Gr\u00f6\u00dfe: S1\nG\u00fcte: A\nKlasse: Milit\u00e4r\n\nEntwickelt f\u00fcr das Schlachtfeld: Das V801-11 hebt sich dank strenger, iterativer Testreihen von der Masse ab und garantiert volle Leistung, wenn es darauf ankommt.",
    "zh_CN": "\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u96f7\u8fbe\n\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1a\u65b0\u8303\u5f0f\u96c6\u56e2\uff08Groupe Nouveau Paradigme\uff09\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a1\n\u7b49\u7ea7\uff1aA\n\u5206\u7c7b\uff1a\u519b\u7528\n\n\u4e13\u4e3a\u6218\u573a\u8bbe\u8ba1\uff0cV801-11 \u51ed\u501f\u4e25\u683c\u7684\u8fed\u4ee3\u6d4b\u8bd5\u51fa\u7c7b\u62d4\u8403\uff0c\u786e\u4fdd\u5728\u60a8\u6700\u9700\u8981\u65f6\u53d1\u6325\u5176\u4f18\u5f02\u6027\u80fd\u3002",
    "fr_FR": "Type d'article : Radar\nFabricant : GNP\nTaille : 1\nQualit\u00e9 : A\nClasse : Militaire\n\nCon\u00e7u pour le champ de bataille, le V801-11 surpasse largement les autres, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des tests rigoureux et it\u00e9ratifs qui garantissent ses performances lorsque vous en avez le plus besoin."
   },
